      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This is not something that needs to be explicitly whitelisted by VRChat, as it's already entirely doable by users right now. LOD groups are a default unity feature that are not blocked in worlds. Amplify impostors have a complex baking process in editor, but at runtime they are simply a shader, and can be uploaded with the world like any other shader. Simplygon is also a good alternative to generating lower-detail versions of meshes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
