      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}\n\nFantastic response! Thank you so much for sharing not only that it's currently possible, but some tips as well! I was checking the components whitelist and documentation and didn't see any mention, so the assumption was made that it wasn't supported/possible.",
