  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-02-06T19:45:48.664Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When making some worlds with larger areas to explore, it'd be great if we could imposter trees or other objects within LOD Groups. As is we have to either double our modeling efforts or completely cull objects that would clearly be in view. In general limiting object pop-in would lend itself greatly for more immersive worlds that have legitimate need for a larger space. Please consider offering a World SDK and LOD Group supported form of imposters.",
